# Env files and mounted credentials are runtime-only (compose's env_file /
# volumes). Every Dockerfile's build stage does `COPY . .`, and the
# seed-demo image keeps the whole workspace in its final layer — without
# these lines a local .env would be baked into an image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
infra/secrets
